carla_uav_tracking/scene/scene_manager.py:1:"""Scene management — actor lifecycle, spawning, and cleanup.
carla_uav_tracking/scene/scene_manager.py:3:Composes each episode as: 1 language-specified TARGET + N distractors, with
carla_uav_tracking/scene/scene_manager.py:4:>=2 distractors visually similar to the target (design §5.1/§6.3), co-located on
